Subject: [PATCH 2/7] media: platform: add missing put_device() call in mtk_jpeg_probe()
Date:   Fri, 9 Oct 2020 20:37:59 +0800
Message-ID: <20201009123804.3977562-3-yukuai3@huawei.com>
